# The build context is os/build-env/deb/, and the only thing this image needs
# out of it is the filtered lock os/build-env/build.sh writes there. Everything
# else is excluded by default rather than by enumeration -- an allow-list
# cannot be outgrown by a file somebody adds later, and this is the same shape
# os/pkgs/rauc/Dockerfile.dockerignore uses.
*
!images.lock
